ansition period, or retrospective rule is stated in the retained units. Unit u30 dates an FAQ to 30 September 2010, but that date identifies the FAQ rather than the control’s effective date.\",\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u24\",\"u30\",\"u31\"],\"status\":\"AMBIGUOUS\"},{\"dimension\":\"dependencies\",\"explanation\":\"Applying section 103, paragraph 3.11, paragraph 2.3, and advertising-guideline requirements requires the missing external authorities identified in the diagnostic. The circular’s own descriptions support a provisional reading only.\",\"source_unit_ids\":[\"u7\",\"u10\",\"u12\",\"u21\",\"u22\",\"u29\",\"u30\",\"u31\"],\"status\":\"AMBIGUOUS\"}],\"questions\":[\"Does the complete text of Code of Conduct paragraph 3.11 define actor or product scope more narrowly than the quotation in u14?\",\"Does the fee/charge discount exception apply to a mixed package containing both discounts and non-discount benefits?\",\"What effective dates and amendments govern section 103, paragraph 3.11, paragraph 2.3, and the cited advertising guidelines?\",\"Does the statutory authorization or exemption in section 103 apply to the described distributor arrangement?\"],\"readings\":[{\"assumptions\":[\"The assessment concerns one identified offer or proposed offer to a client.\",\"Gift classification, product linkage, and distributor status are supplied professional judgments.\",\"The result tests only the selected paragraph-3.11 gift control.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors)\",\"unit_id\":\"u1\"},{\"quote\":\"distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.\",\"unit_id\":\"u14\"},{\"quote\":\"If gifts are offered in such a way that they are linked to a particular type of investment product\",\"unit_id\":\"u14\"}],\"distinction\":\"Reading A treats the quoted paragraph-3.11 wording as product-wide